      "content": "the thing is there aren't any \"others\". everyone i meet just feels like they're built differently. like i'm watching a movie in a different language and i'm just waiting for the subtitles to start but they never do. i'm just so done with trying to translate myself every single day. it feels like a waste of energy at this point.",
