      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just not worth it though. the language, the translating, even the \"saving it\"... it's all just more work for a life that feels empty. sometimes i think i'm just here by mistake. like, if i weren't here, the world would just be quieter, and i wouldn't have to keep failing at being human.",
